    {
      "source": "In contrast to <a href=\"SpringBeanFacesELResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.jsf.el\"><code>SpringBeanFacesELResolver</code></a>, this ELResolver variant\ndoes <i>not</i> resolve JSF variable names as Spring bean names. It rather\nexposes Spring's root WebApplicationContext <i>itself</i> under a special name,\nand is able to resolve \"webApplicationContext.mySpringManagedBusinessObject\"\ndereferences to Spring-defined beans in that application context.",
      "translation": "与<a href=\"SpringBeanFacesELResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.jsf.el\"><code>SpringBeanFacesELResolver</code></a>相比，此 ELResolver 变体<i>不</i>将 JSF 变量名解析为 Spring Bean 名称。相反，它通过一个特殊名称暴露 Spring 的根 WebApplicationContext <i>本身</i>，并能够解析\"webApplicationContext.mySpringManagedBusinessObject\"，该表达式会解引用到该应用程序上下文中由 Spring 定义的 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "The default implementation delegates to <a href=\"../FacesContextUtils.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.jsf\"><code>FacesContextUtils</code></a>,\nreturning <code>null</code> if no <code>WebApplicationContext</code> found.",
      "translation": "默认实现委托给<a href=\"../FacesContextUtils.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.jsf\"><code>FacesContextUtils</code></a>，如果未找到<code>WebApplicationContext</code>，则返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
